{"resourceIdentifier":"1222","resourceName":"Kaiyang 15100 Rural Methane Digesters Project in Guizhou Province, China","description":"Kaiyang 15,100 Rural Methane digesters Project in Guizhou Province  is located in Kaiyang County which consist of 16 townships, Guiyang City, and the annual average temperature is 13.8?. In the proposed project, 15,100 rural biogas digesters will be constructed in 15,100 peasant households of 16 townships. There are 4.15 pigs every peasant household averagely and a standard biogas digester with 8 m3 capacity is constructed. The proposed project will be completed in two years, 7,000 units built in 2007 and 8,100 units in 2008, totally 15,100 units. The owners of the proposed project are 15,100 farmers who construct the biogas digesters. But because thenumber is large and the owners are scatter, Guizhou Haikang Marsh gas Material Trade Co.,Ltd authorized by all the owners execute the power on behalf of all farmers and distribute CERs revenue.Kaiyang 15,100 Rural Methane digesters project in Guizhou Province, China is a rural methane recovery and combustion project.","location":{"latitude":27.116600,"longitude":106.852200},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1222"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Haikang Marsh gas Material Trade Co,Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Panama District, Panama"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"48486"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.R."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_